      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TEARS ARE FLOWING (1) sets the standard after resuming with a determined win at this track, where she was sent out odds-on and won by just under a length. She has already placed in BM64 company and her record at both the venue and distance reads well for this assignment. BLITZWATER (3) resumes with consistent Queensland form, having placed seven times from nine starts in the past 12 months, and her four placings from four runs around 1000m make her a serious danger if she brings that form to this venue. PRINCE OF SPARTA (8) was well-supported first-up and was not beaten far despite finishing last in a small field, with weight relief helping his second-up profile. MISTIFYZOU (6) has the race fitness edge from a recent second at this track and the apprentice claim helps, though her unplaced record at 1000m keeps her more in the place mix.",
